{#
settings/_swipe_actions.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
What a swipe to the right and a swipe to the left does on a row: one select
per direction, each saved on its own when it changes.

A plain form that submits on change and redirects, like the clock beside the
calendar's: the choice decides what the NEXT list draws, so nothing here is
worth streaming back.

The choices are the SwipeAction cases and nothing else. Trash is not among
them, and the hint says why, so nobody adds it back to "complete" the list.

Accepts:
  choices  list<SwipeAction>  every action a direction may take
  right    SwipeAction        what a swipe to the right does now
  left     SwipeAction        what a swipe to the left does now
#}
{% import '_partials/_select.html.twig' as select %}

<div class="px-4 py-3">
    {% for direction, active in {right: right, left: left} %}
        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_swipe_actions_update') }}" data-turbo="false"
              data-controller="ui--auto-submit" class="{{ loop.first ? '' : 'mt-3' }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-swipe-actions') }}">

            <label for="settings-swipe-{{ direction }}" class="block mb-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">
                {{ ('settings.swipe_actions.' ~ direction ~ '.label')|trans }}
            </label>

            <select id="settings-swipe-{{ direction }}"
                    name="swipe{{ direction|capitalize }}"
                    data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                    {{ select.enhance() }}
                    class="select-field w-full h-9 text-sm">
                {% for action in choices %}
                    <option value="{{ action.value }}" {{ action == active ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                        {{ ('settings.swipe_actions.option.' ~ action.value)|trans }}
                    </option>
                {% endfor %}
            </select>
        </form>
    {% endfor %}

    <p class="mt-3 text-[11px] text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.swipe_actions.hint'|trans }}</p>
</div>
